  "details": "The state of the button that changes the user color is not fixed. \nI think it used to be fixed even if you moved the world or changed the avatar.\nSteps to reproduce↓\n1.Toggle User color change button(e.g. Trusted-> User)\n2.Change Avatar(or Reset Avatar or Move world)\n3.You can see the toggle changing on its own\nIt may not be such a serious bug, but it's annoying.\nI hope you fix it someday.\nI'm not an English speaker, so I'm not good at English. sorry.\nIf you have any additional questions please ask.\nI'm sorry if there is a similar Canny.",
